Nebby has appeared a number of times in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, usually coinciding with its Trainer Lillie. The first cards featuring Nebby were released in the , exclusively in Japan. It contained the from the and the expansions with alternate art featuring Lillie, as well as a printing of that included Nebby as a Cosmog. The first English language card tied to Nebby was Solgaleo & Lunala in , which includes both Pokémon and Lillie in all printings. Lastly, features a group of cards with Nebby in all four of its evolutionary stages. Lillie is included in the art of each, and they form two sets of s: One ends on the card, the other ends on the card.

